        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye bg’aho, Agiripa na Berenike bazanana icubahiro cinshi, binjirana mw ikombe n’abakuru b’abagabisha b’abasoda n’abahambaye bo mur’ ico gisagara; maze Fesito avuga ko bazana Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.2.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 2:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Fesito aravuga, ati Mwami Agiripa, namwe mwese abo turi kumwe hano, murabona uyu, uwo ishengero ry’Abayuda bose bānsabira i Yerusalemu bo n’ino, basemerera ngo ntagikwiye kubaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko nsanga ntiyakoze igikwiye kumwicisha, kand’ ubgiwe agomvye kwitwara kuri Augusito, ngabira kumumurungikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
